# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# fermentation-shorts — files that should never be committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rendered videos (regenerable) -----------------------------------------
# Every .mp4 in this repo is produced from its .html source with _gerar-mp4.js.
# They are ~288 MB in total, so they stay out of git.
# Regenerate with:  node _gerar-mp4.js --w=1080 --fps=30 --kbps=3000 --cfr=1 <file>.html
*.mp4

